  "details": "The librabbitmq packages provide an Advanced Message Queuing Protocol (AMQP) client library that allows you to communicate with AMQP servers using protocol version 0-9-1.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * rabbitmq-c: rabbitmq-c: Heap buffer overflow leading to denial of service (CVE-2026-44236)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
